{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Add and style a vector tile source"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This example uses UIKit"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","name":"Note"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This example shows how a vector data source can be added and a style for it can be configured dynamically.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The tiles are ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/demotiles\/tree\/gh-pages\/tiles-omt","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" that use the OpenMapTiles schema. We are interested in the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/openmaptiles.org\/schema\/#poi","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" that are in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"poi","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" layer, and filter this further with an ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSPredicate","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to only show POIs with a ","type":"text"},{"code":"class","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" of shop. Each POI has a ","type":"text"},{"code":"rank","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" which is normally used to reduce label density. In this example, we use it to demonstrate how a numeric attribute can be used for styling with the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/maplibre.org\/maplibre-style-spec\/expressions\/#step","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" expression. POIs with a rank between 0 and 10 get a red color, between 10 and 20 green, etc.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["class DDSCircleLayerExample: UIViewController, MLNMapViewDelegate {","    var mapView: MLNMapView!","","    override func viewDidLoad() {","        super.viewDidLoad()","","        mapView = MLNMapView(frame: view.bounds, styleURL: AMERICANA_STYLE)","        mapView.autoresizingMask = [.flexibleWidth, .flexibleHeight]","        mapView.tintColor = .darkGray","","        \/\/ Set the map’s center coordinate and zoom level.","        let innsbruck = CLLocationCoordinate2D(latitude: 47.26497, longitude: 11.4088)","        mapView.setCenter(innsbruck, animated: false)","        mapView.zoomLevel = 14","","        mapView.delegate = self","        view.addSubview(mapView)","    }","","    \/\/ Wait until the style is loaded before modifying the map style.","    func mapView(_: MLNMapView, didFinishLoading style: MLNStyle) {","        let source = MLNVectorTileSource(identifier: \"demotiles\", configurationURL: URL(string: \"https:\/\/demotiles.maplibre.org\/tiles-omt\/tiles.json\")!)","","        style.addSource(source)","","        let layer = MLNCircleStyleLayer(identifier: \"poi-shop-style\", source: source)","","        layer.sourceLayerIdentifier = \"poi\"","        layer.predicate = NSPredicate(format: \"class == %@\", \"shop\")","","        \/\/ Style the circle layer color based on the rank","        layer.circleColor = NSExpression(mglJSONObject: [\"step\", [\"get\", \"rank\"], 0, \"red\", 10, \"green\", 20, \"blue\", 30, \"purple\", 40, \"yellow\"] as [Any])","        layer.circleRadius = NSExpression(forConstantValue: 3)","","        style.addLayer(layer)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"DDSCircleLayerExample.png"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Map data from OpenStreetMap. Style uses OpenMapTiles."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/ddscirclelayerexample"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"title":"Vector Tile Sources","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre"]]},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Styling and Dynamic Data","identifiers":["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/AnimatedLineExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/WebAPIDataExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/LineStyleLayerExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/POIAlongRouteExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/GeoJSON","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/PMTiles","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/FeatureStateExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/FeatureStateVectorExample"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Styling-and-Dynamic-Data"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/DDSCircleLayerExample","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/LineStyleLayerExample":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/LineStyleLayerExample","title":"Using GeoJSON with a line style layer","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Adding an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNLineStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":" to the map using a GeoJSON file."}],"role":"article","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/linestylelayerexample"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/WebAPIDataExample":{"title":"Showing data from an API","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/WebAPIDataExample","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/webapidataexample","abstract":[{"text":"Showing data from an API with custom styling and interaction","type":"text"}],"role":"article","kind":"article","type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/POIAlongRouteExample":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/POIAlongRouteExample","kind":"article","type":"topic","title":"POI Along a Route","role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/poialongrouteexample","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Use an "},{"code":"NSPredicate","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to show POI and road labels along a route."}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/PMTiles":{"abstract":[{"text":"Working with PMTiles","type":"text"}],"kind":"article","title":"PMTiles","type":"topic","role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/pmtiles","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/PMTiles"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/GeoJSON":{"title":"Working with GeoJSON Data","abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/geojson","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/GeoJSON","kind":"article"},"https://maplibre.org/maplibre-style-spec/expressions/#step":{"titleInlineContent":[{"text":"step","type":"text"}],"type":"link","title":"step","identifier":"https:\/\/maplibre.org\/maplibre-style-spec\/expressions\/#step","url":"https:\/\/maplibre.org\/maplibre-style-spec\/expressions\/#step"},"https://github.com/maplibre/demotiles/tree/gh-pages/tiles-omt":{"titleInlineContent":[{"text":"tiles around Innsbruck, Austria","type":"text"}],"type":"link","title":"tiles around Innsbruck, Austria","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/demotiles\/tree\/gh-pages\/tiles-omt","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/demotiles\/tree\/gh-pages\/tiles-omt"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/FeatureStateVectorExample":{"abstract":[{"text":"This example demonstrates feature state on a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/